# Cursor Rules for Claveo

## File Creation Rules
- NEVER create or write markdown (.md) files unless explicitly requested by the user
- Do not proactively create documentation files, README files, or any markdown files
- Only create markdown files when the user explicitly asks for them

## Code Style
- Follow Swift/SwiftUI best practices
- Maintain consistency with existing codebase patterns
- Use proper Swift naming conventions

## Project Context
- This is a SwiftUI iOS app for music practice (metronome, tuner, recordings, music dictionary)
- The app uses a tab-based navigation structure
- Future features planned: habit tracking/journal, OMR (Optical Music Recognition) support

